\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces First-choice requests by school group, 2021--22 through 2026--27. Left panel: counts of first-choice requests at promotion-eligible schools and at other schools, with a hypothetical series that adds the 601{} promoted families to eligible schools in 2025--26, as if each had ranked its own school first. Right panel: the same series as shares of all first-choice requests. Promotion sharply cuts observed first choices at eligible schools, and the hypothetical series more than restores them, lifting the eligible share slightly above its 2024--25 level. Source: \texttt  {output/first\_rankings\_by\_year.csv}.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
