\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Left: certainty equivalent of the lottery as a function of CARA risk aversion $r$, for each lottery definition; the dotted line is the certainty equivalent implied by the 73\% take-up rate, and markers are the estimates. Right: for each school, the share of eligible families choosing the lottery against the school's indifference point $r^*_k$ (marker area proportional to eligible families). Under heterogeneous risk aversion these points trace the CDF of $r$ and should rise from left to right.}}{18}{}\protected@file@percent }
